{"id":"95a545f1-d49c-492c-a740-213ff78a0990","revision":0,"last_node_id":32,"last_link_id":47,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[0,-380],"size":[3140,330],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Arbor · Pick the best takes (Qwen Image 2.1 Turbo)\n\nRender every shot with several seeds, look at them side by side, then keep one take per shot — without rendering again.\n\n1. **Cross Reference** (*group* on) pairs every shot with every seed from **Number Sequence**: one branch per shot, four takes each. Two **Tree to Data** feed the prompts and the seeds to the sampler — 16 images in one run.\n2. **Construct Tree** puts the pictures back into one branch per shot and **Image Grid** shows them: a row per shot (labelled from *Shot names*), a column per seed.\n3. Type the take to keep for each shot in **Picks** — one line per shot, `0` to `3` (`1, 3` keeps two). **Reshape Tree** *graft* makes one branch per line, and **List Item** with that tree as its *index* lets every shot pick its own take; **Reshape Tree** *flatten* lines the picks up as one list.\n4. The chosen takes are saved with their shot names (`output/arbor/picks/Dusk.png …`) and laid out as a captioned sheet.\n\nChange the picks and run again: ComfyUI keeps the rendered takes, so only the picking runs — instant. More seeds: raise *count*; more shots: add lines to *Shots* and *Shot names* (and *Picks*)."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## Arbor · Pick the best takes (Qwen Image 2.1 Turbo)\n\nRender every shot with several seeds, look at them side by side, then keep one take per shot — without rendering again.\n\n1. **Cross Reference** (*group* on) pairs every shot with every seed from **Number Sequence**: one branch per shot, four takes each. Two **Tree to Data** feed the prompts and the seeds to the sampler — 16 images in one run.\n2. **Construct Tree** puts the pictures back into one branch per shot and **Image Grid** shows them: a row per shot (labelled from *Shot names*), a column per seed.\n3. Type the take to keep for each shot in **Picks** — one line per shot, `0` to `3` (`1, 3` keeps two). **Reshape Tree** *graft* makes one branch per line, and **List Item** with that tree as its *index* lets every shot pick its own take; **Reshape Tree** *flatten* lines the picks up as one list.\n4. The chosen takes are saved with their shot names (`output/arbor/picks/Dusk.png …`) and laid out as a captioned sheet.\n\nChange the picks and run again: ComfyUI keeps the rendered takes, so only the picking runs — instant. More seeds: raise *count*; more shots: add lines to *Shots* and *Shot names* (and *Picks*)."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":2,"type":"Arbor_Panel","pos":[0,0],"size":[420,300],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":7,"type":"*","link":null},{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"识别数值","name":"parse_numbers","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"parse_numbers"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"整段文本","name":"multiline","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"multiline"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":6,"type":"*","links":null},{"localized_name":"数据树","name":"tree","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":[1]}],"title":"Shots · one per line","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Arbor_Panel"},"widgets_values":["wide shot at dusk, an old white lighthouse on a rocky headland, huge waves breaking below, its beam just switching on against a violet sky\nthe lighthouse keeper, an old man with a white beard in a knitted sweater, climbs a spiral iron staircase holding an oil lantern, warm light on the stone walls\nclose-up of the great glass lens of the lighthouse turning, light flaring through the prisms in rainbow streaks\nfrom the sea at night, a small fishing boat with a single lamp follows the lighthouse beam home through the rain",false,false,""],"widgets_values_named":{